Host- and firmware-oriented tests live in subdirectories:

- `test_relay_controller/`: pure relay policy checks that run in native environments.
- `test_config/`: planned (reserved for future config/Auth validation tests).

Run current host test:

```bash
g++ -std=c++17 -Iinclude test/test_relay_controller/test_pulse_policy.cpp -o /tmp/pulse_policy_test && /tmp/pulse_policy_test
```

PlatformIO test runner will be added when the full firmware test toolchain is
provisioned in CI/dev environments.
